# Lean build context for the dashboard image.
#
# The build context is the PLUGIN ROOT (the launcher pins it via
# Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent — i.e. this dir), so it also contains
# commands/, agents/, skills/, README.md, plugin.json, and the rest of scripts/.
#
# Strategy: deny everything, then re-include ONLY the two runtime paths the image
# needs. This guarantees the plugin's commands/agents/skills, docs, tests, the
# other scripts (dashboard_launcher.py, pr_resolver.py), and __pycache__ never
# enter the build context — nothing but the server + its baked UI assets is
# available to COPY.
*

# Re-include only the runtime files (NOT a blanket !scripts/, which would readmit
# tests and unrelated tooling). Docker needs the directory entries re-included so
# the traversal reaches the files below.
!scripts
scripts/*
!scripts/dashboard_server.py
!scripts/dashboard_assets
scripts/dashboard_assets/*
!scripts/dashboard_assets/**
